                                                   ns1:kutipanNormalisasi "Bacterial leaf blight occurs in both temperate and tropical rice-growing climate zones, with temperatures between 25°- 34°C and over 70% relative humidity. Conditions of strong wind and frequent, heavy rains (e.g., typhoons) are conducive for disease development (Mew et al., 1993)." ;
